            <div xml:id="d184">

                <pb facs="0163" n="153" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg153"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/2–2849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-02-28T17:00:00+08:00">February 28,
                            1949—5 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received February 28—6:21 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>696. From editorial 28th (reContel 695, February 28) advising against acceptance
                    further American aid until peace achieved, it appears <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >China Press</hi> (H. H. Kung) has committed <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >volte-face</hi> from former position on American assistance Nationalist
                    Government. <pb facs="0164" n="154" xml:id="pg154"/> Paper has recently aligned
                    itself with Li Tsung-jen in factional split in Government and has given him and
                    his peace program its staunch and unqualified support, evincing marked degree
                    its distrust Sun Fo. There exists nevertheless possibility editorial summarized
                    Reftel not in entire accord paper’s policy as American editor, N. F. Allman
                    (well-known for uncompromising support Generalissimo and program all-out
                    Chinese), has been absent from Shanghai number days.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 696; repeated Nanking 448, pouched Canton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
